{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a1affa365d971fb5e2c2120468f7cd91271affc5808d35df829cd0c1cac1b032b0477c99f6f8cea0fcebcaad74d49d953e89dac5f891491f145cadd729be188376\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/413986aec60d606367f14c88886df2675c2f1ce1fc4320ec90ef041ebff35a1b8e9798a522d930f37b954234615d9f62626a9977d331360b6a434af06209096b364217456da32793835d57f6689a12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5889015d0122a9ab38f52b6085f20e1fe7732f40d2feeb382df5bf0f1efc9db684359adfae8ea90406afca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/42c9fa96b4c0540913f8ec98eb11b12c4f585040d21d72fae86835de2ef1464ece2179c96ab4d3508a1594693925a8229df3cf0e76b05fdd84049b7ec107b28ef24f7397e0075a55fac56529aec4a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ca6f5ab7bacc0c61ab7b7c11e1d04dea79621f17035fedf5f8c293d642564b4eca0f600f47e282e1cd1865e7afa863911f21c0476e520477c38d19c93d156191bf2698aec69ee72449541e23525aea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ac60236f5ff5eaca8d98d602d7cd396e086897d579184219c9f5b78aa3ff87e8a4dc3f794a11b0c7e4926eb7a82dbcd714f965153226290323f1375558726574f73ca134fe81d96d7a3476fe38b079\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f8f81e9bc118d20a6ffbf4026c9667a57aa825d20d4c6c252a9124c3aef9b0c3bff37ef21400d9dfe06243b0cb082b1b6d7ea5c0a318bb2d2540dd061723b67d12bd2a830fda2dfde8e2843a80b1a4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bf403e7ac338a2712d8dc5a4430a1c85a06e7229839b4596cab7fb203467008482b36a5d4c09386eb081aef70a4555ef9067545000a0250bd057986c26edca4ab484c01449bc0c66e1a88b21e6387e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e7c511683b42e3be7f47dc1b62f160e40635c2ee11d961c7c8a126966ba12eb5debf7497d12c3c657934fbde7a12ae9651acca099f59062efafb8bf471a56547ed2f92d755383854081f160d24d321\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4cc196c547c257b4e96771e1770782b5a39859cf6ba713ce1a038db2213181bf8307ab7eaeb2312c1cdc7eaf3a2e5755a4ec5e656265eb11354f32e333233e8d3322165c30232bc1c9939507236f43\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/33c427350a8f19e434a3905e4a9113f4e0e491ccd513a170baa65a551cfe9725eb51480cd6fef1ecc6b2fe20f4478a76e8efc0c84a39a0523e6afefda38629a696dce01948140439c5fb179c1a28ea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dfe9e3a84bff5aeae59fdc3fe57b4044fd1966b2bc86c2c89bcde163176a25d0644685629fb62fd422a31c66e0182a969f59b145fff402a218361acc26bb5e76248110da5879ee009507207acc8bd9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1a1ffce45f893ed6ca59277b5917c18db45b5a47cdc098144af1fd113d16b67295d44d333dde79e337fe2e43143de67f5699dce0fbef63866eda19b084f9ab976750acca129eca21cc62eeb9351c14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d2c083078e7c8f84c245a017f8a4683ddba397858abdcc43dbb64af500dd077bf3aaebfc8c4ecda1346ab07d28bd889a0b05a06d463e16a030bb029d92e708ad65f6e40e6eabf1b70ab242f077e744\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53cd9b50bc9c741d0b15dd6782aa9c1e57ec53192075bf489033677756de577172c2914f107c9a504cee1aa72088e502c8c517ba6c8012e0a46bfdd96d087722b9d5724d5b768e14f38820f8d2d03c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c877fd2fbfb8195348e4dfb2f79374e1ac16588317875ea29176b052c8c4468eb4ee484299c0911b15ea029e6d4c899108a8ae5154158c87aac1077e57373aa7b75999e5922ad7868ae36194f9ea6d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/06b19fcc88b6c803a0008194c42eee21c1d00f80a23c0232693c30b47b8efe38bb828871f8dc2a9e9a60bdb604eb53176745ef654d3a8098fd4120abd8e35eb7bbbed8b5c8dbff94772f46e9b5618e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6b22af9a99321eb20287124a45e7a9130693667ca727a91d05c168e0fedb5c6e1f461cd1541e4e06255e7f821308c86c95622d6d2af16e057270ea76abdd106221a4e1ebccae0e1b807d729de581cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e92980dedada697901f30aca455ed1bd61e33de2180d1df904c60209e66e23c803a247c9b0e4d5044b0711aa9f2659a4226a007900415318a140fc781ea7c8827270348f029071208f7a1f04094de5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7bea624afdd6195308b893f4caf0173509b8a2ef6fec92b4288a20f7dae35b8ca9c3e450674864016b8d34f0b5b6ec445d83e8a1796d8c16a6af1312260df8f495a743a8b35c3a175349e28f027ae4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
